note a visit counter that remembers between restarts
allow remembering in the file memory.json
when someone visits the path home do
let visits be what I remember called visits as a number or else 0
let total be visits plus 1
remember total as visits
show a heading with the words Visit counter end words
show a paragraph with the words You are visitor number end words followed by total
reply with the page
end when
start the server on port 8097
